  "extra": {
    "lab_note": "## 3d/multi-image-asset\n\nFour stills of one object (front, side, back, top-down) -> one textured mesh, so an asset is fused from several views instead of hallucinated from one.\n\nSources: four `LoadImage` nodes, each gated, unloaded, and run through its own `Trellis2Conditioning`. The four views share ONE `Trellis2ShapeStage`: the front view conditions the structure stage, the side view the shape stage, the back view the upsample stage, and the top-down view the texture pass. Four shape stages would be four separate meshes, so the lane fuses inside one.\n\nUNET: `trellis_2_int8_convrot.safetensors`. CLIP vision: `dino_v3_vit_l.safetensors` (DINOv3 license, opt-in pack). Structure decode stays at 32.\n\nUpsample `target_resolution` is an int and ComfyUI only accepts 1024-2048 in steps of 128; this graph runs the 1024 floor.\n\nBatch stays 1 and the mesh converts through MeshToFile3D, which keeps only batch item 0. SaveGLB writes the mesh to `output/assets/objects/_lab-multiview/asset_NNNNN_.glb`; MeshToFile3D only converts in memory. Do not mint an Asset Bible row from this graph.\n\nQueue `3d/world-elements` next to place the fused asset in a set.\n\nDINOv3 is Meta's custom commercial-friendly license - not Apache. MIT TRELLIS weights without DINOv3 cannot Queue.\n\nOccupancy: trellis - stop Blender desk, LTX, Wan, Klein denoise. One GB10 job.\n",
    "lab_profile": "3d/multi-image-asset",
    "lab_description": "Four views of one object fused into one textured TRELLIS.2 mesh.",
    "lab_trellis": {
      "unet": "trellis_2_int8_convrot.safetensors",
      "resolution": 1024,
      "stages": [
        "structure",
        "shape",
        "upsample",
        "texture"
      ],
      "textured": true,
      "batch_size": 1,
      "save_prefix": "assets/objects/_lab-multiview/asset",
      "native_only": true
    },
    "lab_app_mode": {
      "enabled": true,
      "default_view": "app",
      "frontend_min": "1.41.13",
      "lane": "3d",
      "occupancy": "trellis",
      "enhance_off_identity": true,
      "handoff": [
        "3d/world-elements"
      ]
    },
    "linearData": {
      "inputs": [
        [
          6,
          "image",
          {
            "label": "Front view",
            "description": "Still already in input/. The face of the object: it conditions the structure stage, so the voxel grid follows this view."
          }
        ],
        [
          10,
          "image",
          {
            "label": "Side view",
            "description": "Still already in input/. 90 degrees round from the front; it conditions the shape stage that refines the geometry."
          }
        ],
        [
          14,
          "image",
          {
            "label": "Back view",
            "description": "Still already in input/. Opposite the front; it conditions the upsample stage, so the refined detail agrees with this side."
          }
        ],
        [
          18,
          "image",
          {
            "label": "Top-down view",
            "description": "Still already in input/. Looked down on from above; it conditions the texture pass that paints the mesh."
          }
        ],
        [
          36,
          "quality",
          {
            "label": "Detail",
            "description": "draft is a quick look. standard is what this App ships tuned for. final is the best this App's own stack can do. A rung never changes size and never leaves this App's model stack. The caption names the steps, CFG, weights, and license Queue actually sends."
          }
        ],
        [
          27,
          "target_resolution",
          {
            "label": "Upsample resolution",
            "description": "Structure resolution the refined shape stage renders at. ComfyUI accepts only 1024-2048 in steps of 128; 1024 is the floor and the lab default."
          }
        ],
        [
          31,
          "steps",
          {
            "label": "Texture pass",
            "description": "Steps on the texture sampler. 12 is the authored pass; 4-6 is a paint draft before you commit the full pass. The mesh geometry does not change."
          }
        ],
        [
          35,
          "filename_prefix",
          {
            "label": "Save prefix",
            "description": "Output stem under the ComfyUI output folder. Keep the assets/objects/_lab-... convention so the mesh lands in the one tree the catalog and the Blender exporter walk."
          }
        ]
      ],
      "outputs": [
        35
      ]
    },
    "linearMode": true,
    "lab_quality": {
      "default": "standard"
    },
    "lab_rel": "3d/multi-image-asset",
    "workflowRendererVersion": "Vue-corrected"
  },
